<p><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://discord.com/channels/327414731654692866/1554549117261324472"><font color="yellowgreen"><big><i>Midnight 12.1.5 PTR Changes 4</i></big></font></a> (Build 70077)
</p><summary><span style="color:#ecbc2a"><big>Coming in 12.1.5 PTR 4</big></span></summary>
<p class="mw-empty-elt"></p><p><span style="color: var(--theme-text-color);"><b>Addon Security</b></span><br>
</p>
<ul><li><a href="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API:C_UnitAuras.AddAuraSound" title="API:C UnitAuras.AddAuraSound">C_UnitAuras.AddAuraSound</a> now limits any sound it plays to 5 seconds and rejects throttleSeconds values greater than 5 seconds.</li></ul>
<p><span style="color: var(--theme-text-color);"><b>Miscellaneous</b></span><br>
</p>
<ul><li><a href="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API:C_Intl.GetSortKey" title="API:C Intl.GetSortKey">C_Intl.GetSortKey</a> no longer returns nil when passed an empty string and <code>Enum.CollationStrength.Primary</code>.</li></ul>
